{"id":"b3ccc46813ef213a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-logic-k4w.md","title":"Modal Logic K4W","display":"df-modal-logic-k4w — Modal Logic K4W","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-logic-k4w","aliases":["89-df-modal-logic-k4w"],"display":"df-modal-logic-k4w — Modal Logic K4W","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-logic-k4w"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-logic-k4w</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-logic-k4w — Modal Logic K4W"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}k4w}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K4W}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}k4w}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K4W}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4W}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4W}\\)</span> : K4W逻辑（GL的等价形式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> : 带公理4的模态逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4W} = \\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4W} = \\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>：两种等价定义方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-lob-axiom]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{K4}$ : 带公理4的模态逻辑 (see [[89-df-modal-logic-k4]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}k4w}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{K4W}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{K4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4W}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4W} = \\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1148,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4w]]"}],"outgoing":["d9f30bc0c9c793d3","491579297d817026","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d"]}